    "block_bbox": [
     175,
     443,
     879,
     471
    ],
    "block_content": "Clearly,  $ \\mathbb{E}_{H_0}[T] = 0 $. To find a lower bound for  $ \\mathbb{E}_{H_1}[T] $, we first note that"
   },
